    "name_raw": "Magical Tail",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Race Guide pg. 193",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Race Guide pg. 193\nYou grow an extra tail that represents your growing magical powers.\n\nPrerequisites: Kitsune.\n\nBenefit: You gain a new spell-like ability, each usable twice per day, from the following list, in order: disguise self, charm person, misdirection, invisibility, suggestion, displacement, confusion, dominate person. For example, the first time you select this feat, you gain disguise self 2/day; the second time you select this feat, you gain charm person 2/day. Your caster level for these spells is equal to your Hit Dice. The DCs for these abilities are Charisma-based.\n\nSpecial: You may select this feat up to eight times. Each time you take it, you gain an additional ability as described above.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "Advanced Race Guide pg. 193",
        "href_raw": "http://paizo.com/products/btpy8rv2?Pathfinder-Roleplaying-Game-Advanced-Race-Guide",
